window.T23_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"baggage – cotton","cards":[{"w":"baggage","p":"n.","d":"suitcases and personal belongings packed for traveling; luggage","c":"行李；行囊；包袱","s":"Passengers are allowed to carry one small bag and check in a piece of baggage free of charge.","t":"旅客可攜帶一只小包並免費託運一件行李。"},{"w":"baggage claim","p":"n.phr.","d":"the designated airport area where arriving passengers collect luggage","c":"行李提領處","s":"After clearing international customs, tired travelers followed directional signs to the baggage claim area to pick up their luggage.","t":"通過國際海關後，疲憊的旅客遵循指示牌前往行李提領處區域提領行李。"},{"w":"bet","p":"v./n.","d":"to risk something on the outcome of an unpredictable event; a wager","c":"打賭；下注 (v.)；賭注；穩當的選擇 (n.)","s":"Many financial analysts strongly advise investors never to bet all their savings on a single volatile stock.","t":"許多財務分析師強烈建議投資人切勿將全部積蓄押注在一檔波動劇烈的股票上。"},{"w":"broadcast","p":"n./v.","d":"a radio or television transmission; to transmit a program over the air","c":"廣播節目；電視轉播 (n.)；播放；廣播 (v.)","s":"Millions of enthusiastic soccer fans tuned in to watch the live broadcast of the World Cup championship match.","t":"數百萬熱情的足球迷準時收看世界盃冠軍爭霸戰的現場實況轉播。"},{"w":"chat","p":"v./n.","d":"to talk in a friendly and informal way; an informal conversation","c":"閒聊；談天 (v.)；輕鬆閒談 (n.)","s":"The two old classmates sat on the veranda to chat about their memorable high school experiences for hours.","t":"兩位老同學坐在陽台上，閒聊了數小時他們難忘的高中經歷。"},{"w":"chatty","p":"adj.","d":"readily engaging in friendly, informal talk; talkative","c":"愛聊天的；健談的","s":"Our friendly and chatty taxi driver happily shared fascinating stories about historic city landmarks during the ride.","t":"我們那位親切且健談的計程車司機在車程中愉快地分享了關於歷史城市地標的迷人故事。"},{"w":"cherry","p":"n.","d":"a small, round fruit that is typically bright or dark red","c":"櫻桃；櫻桃樹","s":"Thousands of tourists travel to Kyoto every spring to admire the breathtaking pink cherry blossoms in full bloom.","t":"每年春天，成千上萬的遊客前往京都欣賞盛開且令人屏息的粉紅櫻花。"},{"w":"collar","p":"n.","d":"the band of material around the neck of a shirt; an animal neckband","c":"衣領；項圈","s":"When the politician was accused of corruption during the live debate, he visibly got hot under the collar.","t":"當那位政客在現場辯論中被指控貪腐時，他顯然氣急敗壞／火冒三丈。"},{"w":"colony","p":"n.","d":"a country or area under the political control of another country","c":"殖民地；群體；群落","s":"Historical archives document how the small island gained full independence after serving as a European colony for centuries.","t":"歷史文獻記錄了這座小島在經歷數世紀歐洲殖民地統治後如何取得完全獨立。"},{"w":"colonial","p":"adj.","d":"relating to or characteristic of a colony or colonies","c":"殖民地的；殖民風格的","s":"The old seaport historic district is renowned for its well-preserved colonial architecture featuring wooden shutters and red tile roofs.","t":"這座古老的海港歷史街區以其保存完好的殖民時代建築聞名，特色為木質百葉窗和紅瓦屋頂。"},{"w":"cotton","p":"n.","d":"a soft white fibrous substance that surrounds the seeds of cotton plants","c":"棉花；棉布","s":"The school nurse carefully dipped a sterile cotton swab into antiseptic lotion to clean the boy's scraped elbow.","t":"學校護理師小心翼翼地將無菌棉花棒浸入消毒藥水，以清潔男孩擦傷的手肘。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"dessert – gallon","cards":[{"w":"dessert","p":"n.","d":"the sweet course eaten at the end of a meal","c":"甜點；甜食","s":"Even though we were completely stuffed after the savory dinner, we made sure to save room for dessert.","t":"儘管吃完豐盛的鹹食正餐後我們已完全飽足，我們依然確保留點肚子吃甜點。"},{"w":"energetic","p":"adj.","d":"showing or involving great activity, drive, or enthusiasm","c":"充滿活力的；精力充沛的","s":"The young pop singer captivated the stadium audience with her wildly energetic dance routine and powerful vocals.","t":"這位年輕的流行歌手以其活力四射的動感舞蹈動作和震撼歌聲吸引了全場體育場觀眾。"},{"w":"energy","p":"n.","d":"the strength and vitality required for sustained activity; power","c":"精力；能量；能源","s":"Governments worldwide are investing billions of dollars to transition from fossil fuels to clean renewable energy.","t":"全球各國政府正投資數十億美元，以從化石燃料過渡到潔淨的再生能源。"},{"w":"expectation","p":"n.","d":"a strong belief that something will happen or be achieved in the future","c":"期望；期待；預期","s":"The highly anticipated blockbuster sequel was so breathtaking that it easily lived up to the audience's high expectations.","t":"這部備受期待的賣座續集精彩絕倫，輕鬆達到了觀眾的高度期望。"},{"w":"expect","p":"v.","d":"to regard something as likely to happen; to anticipate","c":"期待；預期；要求","s":"You cannot reasonably expect instant fluency in a foreign language after studying it for merely three weeks.","t":"僅僅學習三週之後，你無法合理地指望在一門外語上達到立即的流利度。"},{"w":"faint","p":"adj./v./n.","d":"barely perceptible; to lose consciousness temporarily from weakness","c":"微弱的；模糊的 (adj.)；昏倒 (v.)；暈厥 (n.)","s":"There was only a faint glimmer of light visible in the distance as we navigated the dark mountain pass.","t":"在黑暗的山路隘口前行時，遠處只有一抹微弱的光芒隱約可見。"},{"w":"fairy","p":"n.","d":"a mythical being of human form with magical powers and wings","c":"小仙子；小精靈","s":"In classic folklore, the benevolent fairy godmother magically transformed a humble pumpkin into a golden royal carriage.","t":"在經典民間故事中，仁慈的仙女／神仙教母用魔法將一顆不起眼的南瓜變成了金色皇家馬車。"},{"w":"fairy tale","p":"n.phr.","d":"a children's story about magical and imaginary beings and lands","c":"童話故事","s":"The ancient castle perched high above the mist-covered lake looked like something straight out of a fairy tale.","t":"聳立在雲霧繚繞湖泊上方的古老城堡，看起來就像是直接出自於童話故事一般。"},{"w":"fare","p":"n./v.","d":"the money paid for travel on public transport; to perform or progress","c":"車資；票價 (n.)；進展；應付 (v.)","s":"Commuters expressed strong dissatisfaction when the municipal transit authority announced another hike in subway fares.","t":"當市立大眾運輸局宣佈地鐵票價再次調漲時，通勤族表達了強烈不滿。"},{"w":"feather","p":"n.","d":"one of the light horny structures that form the plumage of birds","c":"羽毛","s":"The wise old saying states that birds of a feather flock together, as people naturally seek friends with similar values.","t":"有句古老諺語說「鳥以同羽相聚（物以類聚）」，因為人們自然會尋找價值觀相似的朋友。"},{"w":"gallon","p":"n.","d":"a unit of liquid volume equal to 4 quarts (about 3.785 liters in the US)","c":"加侖 (液體容積單位)","s":"Car buyers are increasingly choosing hybrid automobiles that deliver superior miles per gallon on city highways.","t":"購車者日益偏好在城市公路上具有絕佳每加侖行駛里程數的油電混合車。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"gang – queer","cards":[{"w":"gang","p":"n.","d":"an organized group of criminals; a close group of friends","c":"幫派；團伙；一幫朋友","s":"All my old high school friends decided to get the whole gang together for an anniversary reunion.","t":"我所有的高中老朋友決定把那群老夥伴／那一幫人全部找齊來參加週年聚會。"},{"w":"gangster","p":"n.","d":"a member of an organized group of violent criminals","c":"歹徒；黑幫份子","s":"The museum curator displayed historical mugshots and vintage weapons belonging to 1930s Chicago gangster.","t":"博物館策展人展示了屬於 1930 年代芝加哥黑幫份子的歷史犯罪檔案照片與復古武器。"},{"w":"inspect","p":"v.","d":"to look at someone or something closely, typically to check its condition","c":"檢查；審查；視察","s":"Health officials visited the downtown food market unannounced to closely inspect kitchen sanitation standards.","t":"衛生官員突擊造訪市中心食品市集，以嚴密視察／檢查廚房衛生標準。"},{"w":"inspection","p":"n.","d":"careful examination or scrutiny by an official","c":"檢查；檢驗；視察","s":"The newly constructed apartment complex successfully passed the municipal fire safety inspection on its first attempt.","t":"這棟新建的公寓大樓在第一次嘗試時就順利通過了市立消防安全檢查。"},{"w":"inspector","p":"n.","d":"an official whose job is to ensure that regulations are being obeyed","c":"檢驗員；巡查員；警督","s":"A certified building inspector visited the construction site to verify that foundation beams met earthquake resilience codes.","t":"合格的建築檢驗員造訪了建築工地，以核實地基鋼樑是否符合防震法規。"},{"w":"magnet","p":"n.","d":"a piece of material that attracts iron or steel; a source of great attraction","c":"磁鐵；磁石；極具吸引力之人事物","s":"Whenever my family travels abroad, we always purchase a colorful souvenir magnet to stick on our kitchen refrigerator.","t":"每當我們全家出國旅遊時，總會購買一枚色彩繽紛的紀念磁鐵貼在廚房冰箱上。"},{"w":"magnetic","p":"adj.","d":"exhibiting the properties of magnetism; possessing an attractive charisma","c":"有磁性的；有吸引力的","s":"The Earth's powerful magnetic field deflects harmful solar cosmic radiation and causes the spectacular northern lights.","t":"地球強大的磁場能偏轉有害的太陽宇宙輻射，並引發壯觀的極光現象。"},{"w":"mankind","p":"n.","d":"the human race regarded collectively; humankind","c":"人類 (總稱)","s":"Astronaut Neil Armstrong famously declared that his first step on the moon was one giant leap for mankind.","t":"太空人阿姆斯壯著名地宣稱，他登上月球的第一步是「人類的一大步（飛躍）」。"},{"w":"motor","p":"n./adj.","d":"a machine that produces motion or power; driven by an engine","c":"馬達；發動機 (n.)；機動的；肌肉運動的 (adj.)","s":"All drivers must carry valid insurance and registration while operating a motor vehicle on state public highways.","t":"所有駕駛人在州立公共公路上駕駛機動車輛時，都必須攜帶有效保險與行車執照。"},{"w":"penguin","p":"n.","d":"a flightless sea bird of southern regions with flipper-like wings","c":"企鵝","s":"Wildlife documentary filmmakers spent six months in Antarctica capturing the extraordinary breeding habits of the emperor penguin.","t":"野生動物紀錄片團隊在南極洲待了六個月，捕捉帝企鵝非凡的繁殖習性。"},{"w":"poll","p":"n./v.","d":"the process of voting in an election; a survey of public opinion","c":"民意測驗；投票 (n.)；對…進行民調；獲得票數 (v.)","s":"A recent nationwide public opinion poll revealed that healthcare reform remains the top priority among working-class voters.","t":"一項近期的全國公共民意調查顯示，醫療改革依然是勞工階層選民心中的首要任務。"},{"w":"queer","p":"adj.","d":"strange, odd, or unusual; differing from what is standard","c":"奇怪的；古怪的","s":"As we entered the abandoned dilapidated mansion in the dark woods, I had a distinctly queer feeling that we were being watched.","t":"當我們在黑夜森林中走進那座廢棄破舊的宅邸時，我有一種明顯古怪／異樣的感覺，彷彿正被人盯著看。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"quit – vase","cards":[{"w":"quit","p":"v.","d":"to stop, discontinue, or resign from an activity, job, or habit","c":"停止；戒除；辭職","s":"After experiencing recurring chronic chest pains, Arthur finally decided to quit smoking once and for all.","t":"在經歷了反覆發作的慢性胸痛後，亞瑟終於決定徹底戒菸。"},{"w":"spray","p":"n./v.","d":"liquid sent through the air in tiny drops; to apply liquid in fine drops","c":"噴霧；水花 (n.)；噴灑；噴射 (v.)","s":"Organic vegetable farmers prefer to spray natural soapy water on leafy crops rather than utilizing toxic chemical pesticides.","t":"有機蔬菜農民更喜歡在葉菜作物上噴灑天然肥皂水，而非使用有毒化學農藥。"},{"w":"steep","p":"adj.","d":"rising or falling sharply; extremely high (of a price or fine)","c":"陡峭的；急遽的；(價格) 過高的","s":"The novice hikers found themselves catching their breath while ascending the exceptionally steep and rocky mountain trail.","t":"初學者健行者在攀登格外陡峭且多石的山徑時，發現自己氣喘吁吁。"},{"w":"thankful","p":"adj.","d":"pleased and relieved; expressing gratitude for benefits received","c":"心存感激的；欣慰的","s":"During the annual Thanksgiving holiday dinner, our entire extended family gathered around the table to share what we were most thankful for.","t":"在每年的感恩節假期晚餐期間，我們整個大家庭圍坐在餐桌旁，分享我們最感激的事物。"},{"w":"trail","p":"n./v.","d":"a marked path through a rough country; to follow behind or track","c":"步道；小徑；蹤跡 (n.)；跟隨；落後 (v.)","s":"Follow the marked yellow painted rocks along the forest trail to reach the secluded mountain waterfall safely.","t":"沿著森林步道跟隨標記有黃色漆的岩石走，即可安全抵達隱蔽的山間瀑布。"},{"w":"tray","p":"n.","d":"a flat, shallow container with a raised rim, used for carrying food or items","c":"托盤；盤子","s":"The polite hotel waiter balanced a polished silver tray carrying hot chamomile tea and freshly baked scones.","t":"禮貌的飯店服務生端平一只裝著熱洋甘菊茶與剛出爐司康餅的拋光銀托盤。"},{"w":"vanish","p":"v.","d":"to disappear suddenly and completely","c":"消失；滅絕；不翼而飛","s":"I distinctly placed my apartment car keys right here on the hall table, but they seem to have vanished into thin air.","t":"我明明把公寓車鑰匙就放在玄關桌上，但它們似乎憑空消失了。"},{"w":"vase","p":"n.","d":"a decorative open container, typically of glass or china, for holding flowers","c":"花瓶","s":"A priceless Ming dynasty vase crafted from white and blue painted porcelain was carefully preserved in the glass display case.","t":"一件以青花瓷手工打造的無價明代瓷花瓶，在玻璃展示櫃中被妥善保存。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"verse – zone","cards":[{"w":"verse","p":"n.","d":"writing arranged with a metrical rhythm, typically having a rhyme; poetry","c":"詩節；韻文；詩篇","s":"Shakespeare composed many of his dramatic plays and famous romantic sonnets entirely in rhyming verse.","t":"莎士比亞完全用韻文詩體創作了他的許多戲劇作品與著名的浪漫十四行詩。"},{"w":"warmth","p":"n.","d":"the quality, state, or sensation of being warm; friendly affection","c":"溫暖；熱情；親切","s":"Sitting on the front porch sipping hot cocoa, we thoroughly enjoyed the gentle warmth of the midday winter sun.","t":"坐在前門廊啜飲熱可可時，我們盡情享受著冬季正午陽光的溫和溫暖。"},{"w":"warm","p":"adj./v.","d":"at a fairly comfortable high temperature; to make or become warm","c":"溫暖的；熱情的 (adj.)；使變暖；加溫 (v.)","s":"The visiting international exchange students received a remarkably warm and enthusiastic welcome at the airport.","t":"來訪的國際交換學生在機場受到了極為熱烈且熱情的歡迎。"},{"w":"wed","p":"v.","d":"to marry; to unite in marriage or close partnership","c":"娶；嫁；與…結婚","s":"The famous young actors announced their intention to wed in an intimate ceremony overlooking the Italian coast next summer.","t":"這對知名青年演員宣布打算明年夏天在俯瞰義大利海岸的私密儀式中成婚。"},{"w":"wedding","p":"n.","d":"a marriage ceremony and its associated celebrations","c":"婚禮；結婚儀式","s":"After the sacred church vows were completed, guests adjourned to the beachfront hotel for a lavish dinner wedding.","t":"神聖的教堂誓言完成後，賓客移步至海灘飯店參加盛大的婚禮招待會／婚宴。"},{"w":"weed","p":"n./v.","d":"a wild plant growing where it is not wanted; to remove unwanted plants","c":"雜草；野草 (n.)；為…除草；淘汰 (v.)","s":"The diligent gardener spent Saturday morning on his knees to carefully pull up unwanted weeds from the flowerbed.","t":"勤奮的園丁週六早晨跪在地上，仔細從花壇中拔除惱人的雜草。"},{"w":"wheat","p":"n.","d":"a cereal plant that yields grain used for making flour and bread","c":"小麥","s":"Endless undulating fields of golden wheat stretched across the horizon under the azure Midwestern summer sky.","t":"在中西部蔚藍的夏日天空下，一望無際且隨風起伏的金黃色小麥田在平線上延展。"},{"w":"wicked","p":"adj.","d":"evil or morally wrong; playfully mischievous","c":"邪惡的；不道德的；淘氣的","s":"In the classic children's fairy tale, the wicked witch cast a dark spell to put the sleeping princess into an eternal slumber.","t":"在經典童話故事中，邪惡的女巫施加了黑暗魔咒，讓沉睡的公主陷入永恆的睡眠。"},{"w":"zone","p":"n./v.","d":"an area or stretch of land having a particular characteristic or purpose","c":"區域；地帶 (n.)；劃分特定區域 (v.)","s":"Hospital regulations strictly mandate that all outdoor patient courtyards be designated as a completely non-smoking zone.","t":"醫院規定嚴格要求所有室外病患中庭均劃定為完全禁菸區。"}]}];
